<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft acquires Philippine firm.</title>
<headline>Datacraft acquires Philippine firm.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Communications and network systems integrator Datacraft Asia Ltd said on Thursday it had acquired Adcoms International, a company in the Philippines.</p>
<p>Datacraft said in a statement it had formed a new company named Datacraft Adcoms (Phils) Inc to undertake the acquisition.</p>
<p>Some of the assets and staff of Adcoms, a network systems integrator, would be transferred to the new company, it said.</p>
<p>Adcoms is a profitable company with over 20 percent market share of the Philippine networking market, the statement said.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the acquisition were not revealed.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
